# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to a root
# `.dockerignore`, which is what lets this benchmark keep its build context
# rules entirely inside bench/ without touching the repository root.
#
# `target/` alone is several gigabytes of host-built artifacts; sending it into
# the build would dominate the build time and, worse, a stale host-built
# artifact could end up in the image.
target
.git
.omc
bench
Dockerfile
deploy
*.md
